Subject: [PATCH] Preserve WhatsApp chat nudges when personal-data autofill is UNKNOWN

The exact focused WhatsApp conversation entry stays UNKNOWN for personal-data
autofill. Skip only its unsupported-field EXIT broadcast after FTU; do not
route chat text into personal-data understanding or change chat eligibility.
All other fields retain the original rejection. Existing registers, labels,
FTU handling and supported-field flow are preserved. Apply after patch 0026.

